			"rating": 1,
			"text": {
				"text": "My right point finger was broken and dislocated. Without XRay, just based on visual assessment, dr Aligrudic recommended physical therapy. That was very painful for me and unmanageable for the therapist.  XRay examination is the basic  thing to do. DrAligrudic failed in that basic thing. When I went abroad, the doctor did not want to see me before I had XRay. Then, after XRay the doctor told me that my bones were dislocated. It was too late for my finger. Dr Aligrudic is unprofessional and careless. He destroyed my finger.",
				"languageCode": "en"
			},
			"originalText": {
